projects also have a characteristic and that is they drive change that projects are changing the current

00:18.800 --> 00:27.110
state to a desired future state that projects are moving from where we are now to a desired state of

00:27.200 --> 00:29.630
what our goals are where we want to be.

00:29.630 --> 00:35.810
So projects are always doing really one of four activities when we're driving change.

00:35.870 --> 00:42.270
We're moving something we're adding something or changing something or deleting something.

00:42.350 --> 00:47.980
And yes you have to do those hand motions when you talk about moving adding changing deleting.

