All right now it's important to recognize this is a quick test.

00:58.730 --> 01:00.460
Are you really doing a project.

01:00.470 --> 01:01.520
Are you changing.

01:01.520 --> 01:03.540
So projects are about change.

01:03.710 --> 01:07.850
So you're moving from your current state to that desired future state.

01:08.090 --> 01:14.690
Now it's possible often likely especially in I.T. that there's a transition state a transition period

01:14.720 --> 01:16.270
as you're making this move.

01:16.520 --> 01:21.830
So imagine that we are on you know Windows X whatever version is popular.

01:21.830 --> 01:29.060
Now we're on Windows X and here comes a new version of Microsoft Windows Windows y which I've often

01:29.660 --> 01:30.800
have asked that question.

01:30.830 --> 01:31.250
All right.

